{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>佐敦一間便利店遇劫，損失數百元。</p><p></p><p>便利店女職員向警方講述案發經過。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ROBBERY-0600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zDuszitmJn1792363591.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方指在清晨四時許，一名50多歲男子手持一塊磚頭，進入佐敦道9號一間便利店，搶走收銀機內數百元後持著磚頭逃去。事故中無人受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.891622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:57:46.270736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:35.609124+00:00","content_hash":"ae066d298241f7ec4e7642d29b8820ef7cf65642f1563b01cd1cb1414d9c7021","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}